{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41627","headline":"番禺道中作 · 陈陶","name":"番禺道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"博罗程远近，海塞愁先入。\n瘴雨出虹蝀，蛮江渡山急。\n常闻岛夷俗，犀象满城邑。\n鴈至草犹春，潮回樯半湿。\n丹丘凤皇隐，水庙蛟龙集。\n何处树能言，几乡珠是泣。\n千年赵佗国，霸气委原隰。\n龌龊笑终军，长缨祸先及。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}